  "date": "2026-11-01",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "金融法草案将二次审议，要加强对互联网营销和跨境金融的管理",
  "title_en": "Draft Financial Law to get second review, with tighter management of internet marketing and cross-border finance",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月30日，全国人大常委会法制工作委员会的发言人黄海华开了记者会。他说，十四届全国人大常委会的第二十五次会议，将审议金融法草案的第二个版本。",
      "en": "On October 30, Huang Haihua, spokesperson of the Legislative Affairs Commission of the NPC Standing Committee, held a press conference. He said the 25th meeting of the 14th NPC Standing Committee will review the second version of the draft Financial Law."
    },
    {
      "zh": "全国人大常委会是中国负责制定和修改法律的机构之一。这部草案今年6月第一次被审议。后来根据各方面的意见，草案要做四点主要的修改。",
      "en": "The NPC Standing Committee is one of the bodies in China that makes and revises laws. This draft was reviewed for the first time in June this year. Later, based on opinions from many sides, the draft is to be revised in four main ways."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第一，加强对金融消费者和投资者权利的保护。第二，对资产管理的产品和服务，用统一的规则来管理。",
      "en": "First, strengthen the protection of the rights of financial consumers and investors. Second, manage asset management products and services with unified rules."
    },
    {
      "zh": "第三，对互联网营销等活动，增加有针对性的规定。第四，加强对跨境金融活动的管理。",
      "en": "Third, add targeted provisions for activities such as internet marketing. Fourth, strengthen the management of cross-border financial activities."
    }
  ],
